[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was marked known: one issue, one fix queued. Its reports describe
more than one problem, and each now has its own ticket, linked below.

Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October:

- `parser`: fixed by `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`. Its ticket is closed.
- `hint`: won't fix, the booking-v3 form is retired. Its ticket is closed.
- `shift`: not part of the fix. Its ticket stays open.

<Callout kind="warn">
The one-day shift has no fix yet. Its ticket stays open.
</Callout>

## The split

<ProblemTable
  ticket={4471}
  tickets={{
